      "<strong>v1.34.9.3 &mdash; Hide affordance on Patient list rows. Mirrors the Catalog Hide UX (v1.34.9.1) but for patients.</strong> Pre-ship: Karen had Banned + Opted-out signals but no way to soft-remove a patient from her active list without nuking the record. Post-ship: per-row Hide button + Show hidden toggle pill in the filter area; hidden patients are excluded from list, rescue, and recognition flows by default. <strong>No migration</strong>: patients live as <code>knowledge_nodes.attachments</code> JSONB, so the new <code>hidden: boolean</code> field rides alongside <code>banned</code> + <code>vip</code> in <code>PatientContactSummary</code> &mdash; same shape, same re-roll preservation path. A sales-CSV re-upload won&rsquo;t unhide patients (the rollup preserves contact-summary fields like vip + banned + softTags by design). <strong>Server side</strong>: <code>PatientSummary</code> + <code>PatientListRow</code> + <code>PatientContactSummary</code> all gain <code>hidden: boolean</code>; <code>hydratePatientListRow</code> + <code>extractContactSummary</code> propagate it; <code>listInput</code> zod gains <code>includeHidden?: boolean</code> (default false &mdash; list fn filters in-memory after hydrate, post-load so the underlying query stays simple); new <code>setPatientHidden</code> server fn mirrors the setPatientSoftTag JSONB-merge pattern (honors admin viewAs via resolveEffectiveUserId, writes back the full PatientSummary with new <code>hidden</code>). <strong>UI</strong>: per-row Hide / Unhide button as a dedicated table column at the right edge of each PatientRow (matches the existing A-list + Waitlist column shape). Hidden rows render at 60% opacity with hover-to-100% reveal. Show hidden toggle pill renders below the soft-tag filter strip (always visible, regardless of whether any tags exist in the tenant); tap to re-fetch with includeHidden=true. <strong>Optimistic UI</strong>: hide flow drops the row from the visible list immediately (or flips opacity if Show hidden is active); on server failure, full re-fetch restores consistent state. <strong>What this DOESN&rsquo;T ship</strong>: bulk hide / unhide via the v1.34.0 bulk-tag selection flow (one-at-a-time only); confirmation dialog before hide (just toasts); rescue + recognition allocation enforcement that respects hidden (engines still see hidden patients in their scoring queries; suggestions skipping hidden patients lands in a follow-on); a per-tenant default for showing-hidden. <strong>Touched</strong>: <code>src/lib/patient-csv.ts</code> (PatientContactSummary gains hidden field), <code>src/server/patient-ingest.functions.ts</code> (PatientListRow + hydrate + extract + listInput + filter + setPatientHidden fn), <code>src/routes/app.refill.patients.index.tsx</code> (Eye/EyeOff imports + showHidden state + load dep + onToggleHidden handler + Show hidden pill in filter area + Hide column header + per-row Hide button + opacity treatment + onToggleHidden prop threaded through PatientRow), <code>src/lib/changelog.ts</code> (this entry). No migration; no new dependencies.",
