      "<strong>v1.11 &mdash; Repo-wide bg-primary&rarr;bg-emerald sweep (closes the silently-broken-token find from v1.10).</strong> v1.10 surfaced that <code>bg-primary</code>/<code>text-primary</code>/<code>border-primary</code> generate zero CSS in this codebase &mdash; <code>styles.css</code>&rsquo;s <code>@theme</code> block defines emerald/ink/amber/paper/rose but no <code>--color-primary</code>, so Tailwind v4 emits nothing for any primary-keyed utility. On <code>app.billing.tsx</code> alone there were 6 broken refs. v1.10 swept that one file. v1.11 finishes the job: <strong>31 files, 168 surgical replacements</strong>, two-pass mechanical sed:<br /><br /><code>(text|bg|border|ring)-primary-foreground</code> &rarr; <code>$1-paper</code><br /><code>(text|bg|border|ring)-primary</code> &rarr; <code>$1-emerald</code> (preserving <code>/N</code> opacity modifiers)<br /><br /><strong>Affected surfaces</strong>: <code>src/components/ui/button.tsx</code> (the shared shadcn button default + link variants &mdash; was rendering as default-text), <code>src/routes/index.tsx</code> (landing page logo box + CTA buttons + focus ring + icon container), all 12 <code>app.refill.*</code> route files (campaigns / patients / waitlist / inbox / recovery / rescue / settings / sharing / reports / index), both admin routes, all 7 affected components (OnboardingWizard, ServicesEditCard, NotificationCenter, EmptyState, ErrorBoundary, CohortEditor), and pricing.tsx. <strong>What changes visually</strong>: every CTA button, every focus ring, every active-state highlight, every emphasized icon &mdash; what was rendering as default-text-color or transparent now reads as the sage emerald (#056048) that&rsquo;s supposed to anchor the brand. The landing page logo box (the &lsquo;R&rsquo; in a square) was previously invisible-against-paper-bg; now it&rsquo;s the proper emerald square. <strong>Excluded from sweep</strong>: <code>src/lib/changelog.ts</code> (contains historical HTML text referencing primary tokens by name in earlier changelog entries; not class names). <strong>Build proof</strong>: clean vite build, zero TS errors introduced, deploy succeeded. <strong>Memory record</strong>: <code>project-bg-primary-silently-broken.md</code> documents the find with the translation table for any future reference. <strong>Not done</strong>: the &lsquo;Active&rsquo; chip uppercase tracking-wider stays (chip indicators read genre-correct), table column header uppercase stays (compact scan-friendly), shadcn <code>secondary</code>/<code>accent</code>/<code>destructive</code>/<code>input</code>/<code>muted</code> tokens not audited &mdash; if any are also missing from @theme they&rsquo;ll surface in future polish work. Touched: 31 files (.tsx in src/components/ and src/routes/), <code>src/lib/changelog.ts</code> (this entry).",
